<h5 class="mt-3">Aim and Scope:</h5>

<p>International Journal of Advanced Energy Researches (IJAER) is an open access interdisciplinary peer-reviewed journal aiming a strong review process, rapid, and on time publication of unpublished and original researches in form of papers, books, tutorials, and survey articles.</p>

<h5>Evaluation Ethics and Evaluation Malpractice Statement:</h5>

A referee evaluates a paper based on standards regardless of religious, race, gender, sexual orientation, and belief of paper owner. The evaluation process should be performed neutrally. Referee should state his views about the paper clearly with supporting opinions. The paper score is an average of many factors which will be graded by the editor. The referee will consider similarity or overlap between the content of the paper under consideration and other papers. 

